%N A402015 Decimal expansion of L'(1,chi_{-7})/L(1,chi_{-7}), where chi_{-7} is the Dirichlet character kronecker(-7,.).
%F A402015 Equals A402011 - (log Gamma(1/7) + log Gamma(2/7) - log Gamma(3/7) + log Gamma(4/7) - log Gamma(5/7) - log Gamma(6/7)).
%e A402015 L'(1,chi_{-7})/L(1,chi_{-7}) = 0.01563568999372037895...
%o A402015 (PARI) f(D) = my(L=lfuncreate(D)); lfun(L,1,1)/lfun(L,1,0); \\ D is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402015 f(-7)
%o A402015 (PARI) f(D) = my(h = qfbclassno(D)); log(2*Pi) + Euler() - (1/h) * sum(a=1, abs(D), kronecker(D,a)*lngamma(a/abs(D))); \\ D < -4 is a fundamental discriminant
%o A402015 f(-7)
%Y A402015 Cf. A175629 (chi_{-7}). See A402011 for related sequences.
%K A402015 nonn,cons,new
%O A402015 -1,2
